WEBVTT

00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:12,020
My electrolytes results are normal.

00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,700
Why am I thirsty during the night?

00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:14,460
Sometimes.

00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,980
Well, there's lots of reasons why you can be thirsty during the night.

00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,500
You can still be dehydrated.

00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,180
You can still have normal electrolytes.

00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:25,060
So it's not a direct one-on-one relationship there.

00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:36,180
So I'd still make sure you're drinking when you're thirsty.

